{"page":{"id":"ad90b996-1bb2-44c5-b3df-a7fe6cd50bd9","theme":"the-legend-of-zelda","slug":"/the-legend-of-zelda","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/the-legend-of-zelda","title":"The Legend of Zelda","meta_title":"The Legend of Zelda (The Legend of Zelda) — topic, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"The Legend of Zelda is Nintendo's long-running adventure franchise following Link, Princess Zelda, and the struggle for the Triforce across eras of Hyrule.…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/nintendo\" class=\"entity-link\">Nintendo</a>&#039;s epic of <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/link\" class=\"entity-link\">Link</a>, Zelda, and the <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/triforce\" class=\"entity-link\">Triforce</a>.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/shigeru-miyamoto\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Shigeru Miyamoto</strong></a>, <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/nintendo\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Nintendo</strong></a>, <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/tears-of-the-kingdom\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom</strong></a>, <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/ocarina-of-time\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time</strong></a>, <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/breath-of-the-wild\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild</strong></a> and <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/takashi-tezuka\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Takashi Tezuka</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How The Legend of Zelda connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Created By:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/shigeru-miyamoto\" class=\"entity-link\">Shigeru Miyamoto</a>\n            — Miyamoto created The Legend of Zelda.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Produced By:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/nintendo\" class=\"entity-link\">Nintendo</a>\n            — <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/nintendo\" class=\"entity-link\">Nintendo</a> develops and publishes Zelda.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/tears-of-the-kingdom\" class=\"entity-link\">The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom</a>\n            — Tears of the Kingdom continues the Wild era.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/ocarina-of-time\" class=\"entity-link\">The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time</a>\n            — Ocarina of Time is a landmark Zelda game.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/breath-of-the-wild\" class=\"entity-link\">The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild</a>\n            — Breath of the Wild is a modern Zelda game.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Created By:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/takashi-tezuka\" class=\"entity-link\">Takashi Tezuka</a>\n            — Tezuka co-created The Legend of Zelda.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/twilight-princess\" class=\"entity-link\">The Legend of Zelda: Twilight Princess</a>\n            — Twilight Princess is a Zelda game.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/a-link-to-the-past\" class=\"entity-link\">The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past</a>\n            — A <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/link\" class=\"entity-link\">Link</a> to the Past is a classic Zelda game.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">8</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/zelda\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Princess Zelda</strong>\n                    <span>Princess of Hyrule and bearer of Wisdom.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/triforce\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Triforce</strong>\n                    <span>Golden relic of Power, Wisdom, and Courage.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Hyrule</strong>\n                    <span>Kingdom at the heart of the Zelda series.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/the-lege